*__pycache__
*.idea
*.pyc

# Packaged ROS2 "forwarder" runtime bundle: the SDK ships a self-contained app tree
# (its own Python 3.10 interpreter + stdlib, ROS2 dist-packages, ament share resources,
# and prebuilt binaries). This is vendor build output, not authored code — it is kept on
# disk (obtained with the SDK) but must not be versioned. The authored/config bits under
# forwarder/app (conf/, config/, demo/, python/ bindings) stay tracked.
forwarder/app/bin/
forwarder/app/lib/
forwarder/app/local/
forwarder/app/opt/
forwarder/app/share/
